  "notes": "Desktop (Electron-style) music player with in-app window controls (minimize/maximize/close) in the top bar. Distinctive: each table row is a white 12px-rounded card with a 2px light border on a #f6f6f6 canvas, so the song list reads as a stack of cards while still aligning to a column header. Audio-quality tags (Lossless / Hi-Res in amber #f59e0b, HQ / SQ in grey) sit inline before the artist name. Nearly all buttons are 9999px circles/pills in light grey; primary brand tone is a very dark brown (#2c1513) used on icons and Play all text. Selected sidebar item has a grey pill with a thin dark left indicator. Floating circular 'locate current track' button at bottom-right of the list. Hidden-but-verified: header click opens a sort popover with radio options (排列方式 / 排序方向); player queue button opens a floating 播放列表 panel. Album art is placeholder generative artwork."
